<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f0ec">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background:#f2f0ec"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff"><tr><td style="padding:28px 24px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e1a16">

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1e1a16">A service code was created{{ if .ServiceAccount }} for <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .ServiceAccount }}</span>{{ end }}{{ if .ApprovedByUsername }}, approved by <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .ApprovedByUsername }}</span>{{ end }}.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">The code is not in this email: it was shown once, in the terminal that ran <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">ssoossh service enroll</span>. If you did not expect this approval, expire the code.</p>

{{ if .ServerURL }}<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 28px"><tr><td style="background:#2858cd"><a href="{{ .ServerURL }}/service-codes/{{ .EnrollmentID }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 20px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;line-height:20px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none">Review this code</a></td></tr></table>{{ end }}

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse">
  <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Service account</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ if .ServiceAccount }}{{ .ServiceAccount }}{{ else }}{{ join .Principals ", " }}{{ end }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Code expires</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ datetime .CodeExpiresAt }} ({{ remaining .CodeExpiresAt }})</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Certificate life</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ approx .CertificateLifetime }} per redemption</td></tr>
  {{ if .ApproverSourceIP }}<tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Approved from</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .ApproverSourceIP }}</td></tr>{{ end }}
</table>

{{ if .Advanced }}
<p style="margin:32px 0 4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5d5751">Details</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse">
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Bound key</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .PublicKeyType }} {{ .PublicKeyFingerprint }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Key ID</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .KeyID }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Options</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ if .Extensions }}{{ join .Extensions ", " }}{{ end }}{{ if .NoTouchRequired }}{{ if .Extensions }}, {{ end }}no-touch-required{{ end }}{{ if .SourceAddresses }}{{ if or .Extensions .NoTouchRequired }}, {{ end }}from={{ join .SourceAddresses "," }}{{ end }}{{ if .ForceCommand }}{{ if or .Extensions .NoTouchRequired .SourceAddresses }}, {{ end }}command={{ .ForceCommand }}{{ end }}{{ if not (or .Extensions .NoTouchRequired .SourceAddresses .ForceCommand) }}server defaults{{ end }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Requested from</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .RequestSourceIP }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Approved at</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ datetime .ApprovedAt }}</td></tr>
</table>
{{ end }}

<p style="margin:32px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">
Sent because &ldquo;Service code created&rdquo; is on in your {{ if .ServerURL }}<a href="{{ .ServerURL }}/preferences" style="color:#2858cd">notification preferences</a>{{ else }}notification preferences{{ end }}, or because this address is the service code's notification address.
</p>

</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
